{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"SCREEN 640, 480\nDOUBLE BUFFER\n\nSPRITE LOAD 1,\u0022Graphics/hero.png\u0022\nSPRITE ON 1\n\nspriteX = 320\nspriteY = 240\n\nMainLoop:\n  CLSG\n\n  ; Analog r\u00F6relse med v\u00E4nster spak\n  spriteX = spriteX \u002B (JOYAXIS(1, \u0022LeftX\u0022) / 20)\n  spriteY = spriteY \u002B (JOYAXIS(1, \u0022LeftY\u0022) / 20)\n\n  ; H\u00E5ll inom sk\u00E4rmen\n  spriteX = MAX(0, MIN(640, spriteX))\n  spriteY = MAX(0, MIN(480, spriteY))\n\n  ; H\u00F6ger trigger = skjut\n  IF JOYAXIS(1, \u0022RT\u0022) \u003E 50 THEN GOSUB Shoot\n\n  PRINTG AT 0,0,INT(spriteX) \u0026 \u0022 - \u0022 \u0026 INT(spriteY)\n  PRINTG AT 0,1,INT(JOYAXIS(1, \u0022LeftX\u0022)) \u0026 \u0022 - \u0022 \u0026 INT(JOYAXIS(1, \u0022LeftY\u0022))  \n    \n  SPRITE POS 1, spriteX, spriteY\n  WAIT VBL\nGOTO MainLoop","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}